{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WELCOME TO POLAR STAR, WHERE THE MUSIC OF LOUD GUNSHOTS NEVER STOPS.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628980/extras/steamintro-ph.gif?t=1746351065\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blast your way to the top in a deadly tournament of turn-based duels, break the game rules by unlocking various items that turn the power balance upside-down. Calculate all possible outcomes and carefully plan your moves, or just give into the rush and relentlessly gamble with your life on the line.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SHOOT, DRINK, PREPARE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628980/extras/steamact.gif?t=1746351065\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Outsmart and overpower your opponents in a series of turn-based duels, master the three great actions in the wild game of intelligence, skill, trickery and luck. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A TRICK UP YOUR SLEEVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628980/extras/steamitem.gif?t=1746351065\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bend the rules of the game to your will with various items that you unlock throughout the game. Be thoughtful of what and when you use - it can cost you your life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GET RIGHT BACK INTO ACTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628980/extras/steamback.gif?t=1746351065\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Death is not the end - go back to the game almost instantly, don't let the night go silent. Don't be afraid to risk, embrace the rush you get from rolling the dice of life and death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MAKE IT TO THE TOP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628980/extras/steamworld.gif?t=1746351065\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become \u21161 in this god forsaken, ice-cold bar in the middle of nowhere, where even the night sky stars can't shine through the endless blizzard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THIS DEMO HAS:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The first level of the Singleplayer campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The first bossfight in the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cards modifier that changes the main gameplay loop drastically</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless custom mode with Cards modifier unlocked</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 first original tracks</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3628980?t=1746351065","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628980/9a70138c05de8e7362b33ebabf9e1954b7cbeaeb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746351065","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628980/de94a67a79d7bf84ab4f1b4fa605142c73a37267/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746351065","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628980/de94a67a79d7bf84ab4f1b4fa605142c73a37267/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746351065","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WELCOME TO POLAR STAR, WHERE THE MUSIC OF LOUD GUNSHOTS NEVER STOPS.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628980/extras/steamintro-ph.gif?t=1746351065\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blast your way to the top in a deadly tournament of turn-based duels, break the game rules by unlocking various items that turn the power balance upside-down. Calculate all possible outcomes and carefully plan your moves, or just give into the rush and relentlessly gamble with your life on the line.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SHOOT, DRINK, PREPARE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628980/extras/steamact.gif?t=1746351065\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Outsmart and overpower your opponents in a series of turn-based duels, master the three great actions in the wild game of intelligence, skill, trickery and luck. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A TRICK UP YOUR SLEEVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628980/extras/steamitem.gif?t=1746351065\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bend the rules of the game to your will with various items that you unlock throughout the game. Be thoughtful of what and when you use - it can cost you your life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GET RIGHT BACK INTO ACTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628980/extras/steamback.gif?t=1746351065\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Death is not the end - go back to the game almost instantly, don't let the night go silent. Don't be afraid to risk, embrace the rush you get from rolling the dice of life and death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MAKE IT TO THE TOP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628980/extras/steamworld.gif?t=1746351065\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become \u21161 in this god forsaken, ice-cold bar in the middle of nowhere, where even the night sky stars can't shine through the endless blizzard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THIS DEMO HAS:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The first level of the Singleplayer campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The first bossfight in the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cards modifier that changes the main gameplay loop drastically</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless custom mode with Cards modifier unlocked</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 first original tracks</p></li></ul>","developers":["Guntlett"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3625390","name":"Polar Star"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628980/60dcb7dfabb614f6bdb9764af1b88c9f87e9384a/header.jpg?t=1746351065","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.1 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 80 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Vulkan support required</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257131605,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131605/movie480.mp4?t=1746169735","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131605/movie_max.mp4?t=1746169735"},"name":"Polar star - Announce trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257131605/1092b0a872709578031e3b73249e7b8d30c7e3ba/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746169735","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131605/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746169735",